                    "message": "Are either of these calls to sd_bus_error_free() necessary, since SdBusError() sets the input sd_bus_error to SD_BUS_ERROR_NULL?\n\nI guess one call might be good validation it won't cause problems, but I'm not sure why two are needed?\n\nIt might be more helpful to verify that the sd_bus_error name and message fields are now NULL?"
